msgid "Disaster recovery {#disaster-recovery}"
msgstr "재해 복구 {#disaster-recovery}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Task | IBM responsibilities | Your responsibilities |\n"
#| "| --- | --- | --- |\n"
#| "| General | Restore or rebuild the provisioning environments and resources in the affected regions. | <ul><li>Monitor instance and resource states.</li><li>Provision new Qiskit Runtime service [instances](/guides/instances) in an alternate region, if available.</li></ul> |\n"
#| "| Recovery of services | Automatically recover and restore the Qiskit Runtime service capabilities to normal operations. | Resubmit any impacted jobs following recovery. |\n"
